  "description": "Timberjack Deore 12 can be multiple bikes. Its aluminum frame, trail geometry, and 140mm-RockShox Recon Silver RL all push you to push your limits and get playful on the trail. The multiple bottle and cargo mounts plus the versatility of our Alternator dropout system invite you to explore just how far you can take your Timberjack. Bikepacking? You bet. Single-speeding? Sure.\n\nShimano’s Deore 12-speed drivetrain and four-piston brakes keep you confidently in control of the pace, whether picking your way up a steep, techy climb or bombing down a flowy line. We think this all adds up to make Timberjack the best hardtail mountain bike for riders who like a little of everything.",
